OL,3,GNEWSAQueen and Paddington artist joins 
OL,4,Atree festival                          
OL,6,FAn artist whose sketch of the late     
OL,7,FQueen and Paddington Bear went viral   
OL,8,Ffour years ago will decorate a tree at 
OL,9,FBeverley's Christmas Tree Festival this
OL,10,Fyear.                                  
OL,12,FEleanor Tomlinson's artwork of Queen   
OL,13,FElizabeth II hand in hand with         
OL,14,FPaddington Bear captured the nation's  
OL,15,Fattention in 2022.                     
OL,17,FHer creation will be one of 150        
OL,18,Fdisplays transforming Beverley Minster 
OL,19,Ffor the festival, running from 4 to 13 
OL,20,FDecember.                              
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
