OL,3,GNEWSAQueen and Paddington artist joins 
OL,4,Atree festival                          
OL,6,FTomlinson said: "Beverley Minster is   
OL,7,Fsuch a wonderful, historical, beautiful
OL,8,Fbuilding that is iconic to the area, so
OL,9,Fto play a part in something that's     
OL,10,Fbecome such a firm tradition in East   
OL,11,FYorkshire, it's lovely to be a part    
OL,12,Fof."                                   
